    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20173" root="سك" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّينٌ</span></b> , mentioned by Ibn-'Abbád in this art.,
and said in the Mgh to be of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْلِينٌ</span>
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّكُّ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعِّيلٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السُّكُونُ</span>: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سكن</span>.

